## ET-001 Education Venture Profile

**Name:** Online Tutoring Platform  
**Sector:** education-training  
**Stage:** MVP  
**Status:** development  
**GitHub:** https://github.com/Worldwidebro/et-001-online-tutoring-platform  

**What it needs:**
1. Reusable tutoring content (modules, books, courses)
2. Student progress tracking
3. AI-powered personalized learning paths
4. Quality evaluation (does it teach?)
5. Distribution (Gumroad, books, apps)
6. Automation (generate → test → publish workflow)

---

## Integration Points for ET-001

### Content Layer
- **Markdown modules** → stored in repo
- **Structured with YAML frontmatter** (learning objectives, prerequisites, assessments)
- **Indexed with GraphRAG** (semantic search)

### Knowledge Layer
- **Neo4j graph** (student → topic → prerequisite)
- **Mem0** (student memory, learning history)
- **Claude API** (next-lesson recommendations)

### Quality Layer
- **DeepEval** (learning outcome measurement)
- **Langfuse** (track AI-generated explanations)
- **Promptfoo** (evaluate explanation clarity)

### Publishing Layer
- **Pandoc** (Markdown → PDF, EPUB)
- **mdBook** (web-based course browser)
- **Gumroad** (distribution + payment)

### Automation Layer
- **n8n** (trigger: new module → publish pipeline)
- **Temporal** (complex workflows like: Create → Test → Evaluate → Publish)

---

## First Test Content: Algebra Module

**Topic:** Introduction to Algebra (Pre-algebra concepts)  
**Scope:** 1 complete tutoring module (8-12 lessons)  
**Duration:** Student can complete in 4-6 hours  
**Assets:** Text, examples, quizzes, interactive exercises  
**Target Output:** PDF (printable), EPUB (ereader), HTML (web), mdBook (interactive)

---

## Success Metrics for ET-001 Pilot

| Metric | Target | Method |
|--------|--------|--------|
| Content creation time | < 4 hours for 1 module | Time module creation |
| Export formats | 4 (PDF, EPUB, HTML, mdBook) | Test all outputs |
| Knowledge graph build time | < 10 min for module | Benchmark extraction |
| AI evaluation cycle | < 5 min per module | Test DeepEval |
| Gumroad publish | < 15 min setup + test | Manual flow + doc |
| Automation coverage | 80% of workflow | n8n + Temporal combined |

---

## Risks & Assumptions

| Risk | Probability | Mitigation |
|------|-------------|-----------|
| Pandoc/mdBook not installed | Medium | Install via brew/pip first |
| Neo4j not accessible | Medium | Start local Neo4j instance |
| Gumroad API limits | Low | Use web interface, not API |
| Knowledge graph extraction fails | Medium | Test on small sample first |
| Evaluation tools not configured | High | Skip in Phase 5, revisit |

---

## Decision Log

| Date | Decision | Rationale |
|------|----------|-----------|
| 2026-06-06 | Choose ET-001 as pilot | MVP stage, pure education, concrete scope |
| 2026-06-06 | Use Algebra module | Measurable learning outcomes, wide appeal |
| 2026-06-06 | Test all 4 export formats | Different audiences need different formats |
| 2026-06-06 | Include automation testing | Need production-ready workflow |
